WEBVTT

00:00:02.581 --> 00:00:06.761
Between the library and the ride, every class now has its Class Start.

00:00:10.324 --> 00:00:15.484
From its card, the class opens with its channel, length and focus, its title and its

00:00:15.484 --> 00:00:17.504
summary. Classes leads back.

00:00:20.647 --> 00:00:24.904
What the bike will do: thirty minutes, the resistance profile, and eight efforts

00:00:24.904 --> 00:00:28.290
with recoveries from three minutes down to ninety seconds.

00:00:30.971 --> 00:00:35.969
The average is each segment's target power, weighted by how long it lasts. About one

00:00:35.969 --> 00:00:37.995
hundred and fifty four watts.

00:00:41.295 --> 00:00:45.749
The class video waits, parked at its sync point with its controls showing, and goes

00:00:45.749 --> 00:00:46.854
when you leave.

00:00:51.618 --> 00:00:56.295
Video link and sync opens to the class on YouTube, and the moment the ride syncs

00:00:56.295 --> 00:00:56.887
from.

00:01:01.942 --> 00:01:06.843
How do you want to ride? Ride alone is chosen. Group sessions can't be reached yet,

00:01:06.843 --> 00:01:08.855
and the group option says so.

00:01:12.266 --> 00:01:16.701
Start class goes straight into the class ride, alone, with the bike following the

00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:17.275
plan.

00:01:22.590 --> 00:01:27.347
A locked class's address opens the library instead, as does a class the catalogue

00:01:27.347 --> 00:01:28.410
doesn't hold.

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:36.988
The same page, from one column on a phone to two on a desktop.

00:01:43.237 --> 00:01:48.102
What the tests prove: seven behaviour specs and nine unit tests, all green, and the

00:01:48.102 --> 00:01:50.278
first bundle still under budget.

00:01:53.561 --> 00:01:58.164
Telo Ride, from the Telo family, turns a smart bike at home into a game.

00:01:58.509 --> 00:02:03.021
It pairs with the bike over Bluetooth, reads your power and sets resistance for

00:02:03.021 --> 00:02:04.692
every hill and interval.

00:02:05.037 --> 00:02:10.215
Two doors: Race (ride a map against your best-time ghost, bots or people) and

00:02:10.215 --> 00:02:15.663
Classes (ride along to a video, alone or with a group), fed by one progression of

00:02:15.663 --> 00:02:18.653
XP, rider levels, stars and map unlocks.

00:02:18.998 --> 00:02:21.491
A custom workout lives under Profile.
